.git
docs
# Dependencies and build output, at any depth
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/.expo
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.log
# Secrets and local runtime files must never enter an image, at any depth.
# (Images are built from the repository root, so per-service ignore files do not apply.)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.secrets
**/secrets
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*service-account*.json
**/credentials*.json
# Tests are not shipped; the optional local model is provisioned at runtime, not baked.
ai-service/tests
ai-service/models/*.onnx
